<p dir="auto">Clarifies the <code class="notranslate">NotAllowedError</code> exception of <code class="notranslate">PeriodicSyncManager.register()</code>: the required permission is <code class="notranslate">periodic-background-sync</code>, and in Chromium-based browsers it is only granted to sites installed as an app (PWA).</p>
