<p dir="auto">Setting the <code class="notranslate">src</code> property of an <code class="notranslate">HTMLImageElement</code> starts loading the image immediately, even if the element has not yet been added to the document. This sentence is now included in the <code class="notranslate">src</code> property description.</p>
